---
// Risk Matrix 02 Component
---
<section class="v6-section bg-white">
  <div class="sec-container">
    <div class="sec-header">
      <span class="sec-num">RISK MATRIX · 02</span>
      <h2>Five assistants. One library. Zero data loss.</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Every provider graded by export integrity. Complete local archive security across all major AI platforms.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="matrix-grid">
      <div class="matrix-card">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="card-id">OAI-001</span>
          <span class="card-badge secured">SECURED</span>
        </div>
        <h3>ChatGPT</h3>
        <p>Full thread extraction via secure browser automation or conversation JSON import. Preserves system instructions and model markers.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span>284 files backed up</span>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="matrix-card">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="card-id">ANT-002</span>
          <span class="card-badge secured">SECURED</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Claude</h3>
        <p>Complete project &amp; conversation history extraction. Captures multi-file context, artifacts, and inline code blocks cleanly.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span>192 files backed up</span>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="matrix-card">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="card-id">PRX-003</span>
          <span class="card-badge secured">SECURED</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Perplexity</h3>
        <p>Original source lineage preserved. Grabs deep research collections, thread attachments, and inline citation metadata.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span>145 files backed up</span>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="matrix-card">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="card-id">GEM-004</span>
          <span class="card-badge secured">SECURED</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Gemini</h3>
        <p>Seamless Google Takeout JSON parser. Converts massive archive bundles into human-readable Markdown without truncation.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span>98 files backed up</span>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="matrix-card">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="card-id">GRK-005</span>
          <span class="card-badge secured">SECURED</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Grok</h3>
        <p>Direct live conversation sync. Captures real-time reasoning outputs and deep-dive query sessions in pristine format.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span>78 files backed up</span>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="matrix-card summary-card">
        <div class="summary-content">
          <span class="summary-num">797</span>
          <strong>Total files secured locally</strong>
          <p>One predictable folder. Searchable. Backups yours forever.</p>
          <a href="/pricing/" class="buy-button" data-tr-buy>Get TotalRecalls — $24</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .v6-section {
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
  }
  .bg-white { background: #FFFFFF; }
  .sec-sub {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #475569;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .matrix-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6);
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }
  .matrix-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .matrix-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: #2F7BFF;
  }
  .card-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .card-id {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #64748B;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .card-badge {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #DCFCE7;
    color: #166534;
  }
  .matrix-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0F172A;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;
  }
  .matrix-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6) 0;
  }
  .card-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid #F1F5F9;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #64748B;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .card-footer svg {
    color: #2F7BFF;
  }
  .summary-card {
    background: #0F172A;
    border-color: #0F172A;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }
  .summary-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .summary-num {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #38BDF8;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .summary-card strong {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .summary-card p {
    color: #94A3B8;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .matrix-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .matrix-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
